0","kind":"update","title":"Field Test Update - 11 Additional Languages & Fixes","summary":"Field Test Update - 11 Additional Languages & FixesThe Paraxima Field Test is ongoing.Since the start of Steam Next Fest, we've deployed several updates to the demo, expanding language support, improving the onboarding experience, and addressing technical issues reported during testing.More agents can now participate. Fewer technical anomalies should interfere.Today's update also includes another round of translation corrections across gameplay and tutorial text.Here's what's been deployed so fa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:43:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695563","verified_at":"2026-10-21T01:45:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3194090-1846651706694599","game_id":"steam-3194090","kind":"announcement","title":"Field Test Authorized for Steam Next Fest","summary":"Paraxima is at Steam Next Fest! The Paraxima Demo is available now as part of Steam Next Fest!Step into the field and experience our systems-driven, co-op paranormal investigation game. Work together, identify the Entity, and neutralize the Breach.Whether you're playing solo or with friends, now is the perfect time to give Paraxima a try! Play the demo and let us know what you think!Your feedback is incredibly valuable to our team as we continue developing Paraxima. We'd love to hear about your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:16:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694599","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3194090-1846651706681794","game_id":"steam-3194090","kind":"announcement","title":"PARAXIMA Demo Available Now","summary":"Hello Field Agents and Operators,PARAXIMA Demo is available now, so you and your squad can get a head start before the Steam Next Fest.Welcome to E.S.C. As a team of 1-3, your job is to respond to paranormal outbreaks of The Static. Investigate either as a Field Agent or an Operator. Establish the chain of events with evidence to identify the Entity. Follow the protocol to seal it.We’ve put a lot of time and effort into releasing this Demo and we’d really appreciate your feedback. The best way t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:56:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3194090-1846018067936412","game_id":"steam-3194090","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You For 10,000 Wishlists","summary":"10,000 Decoherent Individuals Detected PARAXIMA has officially passed 10,000 wishlists on Steam!That is a significant number of individuals requiring attention.We’ll be taking care of you soon.Thank you to everyone who has wishlisted, followed the project, joined our playtests, shared our posts, or simply kept an eye on what we’re building.There are now 10,000 of you.That should probably concern us. Field Access Is AvailableThe next phase of public access has begun. Your first proper encounter w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T14:34:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936412","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3194090-1842212951297397","game_id":"steam-3194090","kind":"announcement","title":"Paraxima Development Archive #3 | Entity Evolution","summary":"Hello Field Agents and Operators,In this Development Archive, we’re looking at the Entity itself and how its visual design and behavior evolved throughout production.The goal was to make the Entity harder to read visually, while keeping its behavior something players can gradually learn and understand.From Flesh to FormlessEarly in development, the Entity had a more traditional distorted humanoid form, complete with skin, bones, and recognizable facial features.As Paraxima evolved, that physical","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T16:00:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297397","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3194090-1839676055888237","game_id":"steam-3194090","kind":"announcement","title":"Global Threat Level","summary":"Hello Field Agents and Operators,Global Threat Level tracks the rising pressure of a Paraxima containment operation. Both the Operator and Field Agents receive information from the same system, but each role needs to read it differently.The Operator Panel: Data and AnalysisFor the Operator, the focus is on clarity, comparison, and reading the broader situation.The redesigned GTL graph tracks the current threat level and its rate of escalation throughout the session.Sharp spikes mark registered I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T14:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055888237","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3194090-1838407329265819","game_id":"steam-3194090","kind":"announcement","title":"Paraxima Development Archive #2 | Investigation Loop Evolution","summary":"Hello Field Agents and Operators,In this Development Archive, we’d like to show how Paraxima’s investigation loop evolved across different prototypes.The goal changed over time:from collecting evidence, to locating the source, to identifying the Entity by reading its reactions.Prototype 01 - Evidence BoardOne of the earliest versions of Paraxima was built around a physical Evidence Board in the Safe Room.Field Agents scanned anomalies in the field, collected evidence, returned to the Safe Room, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T15:30:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329265819","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3194090-1836506165553885","game_id":"steam-3194090","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Playtest Mission Brief - June 27-28","summary":"The June 27-28 Paraxima Closed Playtest focuses on one of the core parts of the game: identifying the Entity through behavior, rules, and team communication.During the playtest, we want to see how players read the Entity’s reactions, connect them to their own actions, and use that information as a team to identify the Entity. Field Agents will generate information through movement, sound, light, tools, and direct contact with the Breach Zone. The Operator will monitor the mission from the Safe R","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T13:09:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165553885","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3194090-1836506165545712","game_id":"steam-3194090","kind":"announcement","title":"Paraxima Development Archive #1 | The Bracer","summary":"Hello Field Agents and Operators,In this Development Archive, we’d like to show how one of Paraxima’s key Field Agent tools changed during development: the Bracer.The Bracer has always been part of the Field Agent kit. The question was not whether it should matter. The question was how much of the investigation it should carry by itself.Earlier PrototypeEarlier versions tested the Bracer as a central anomaly detector and scanning device.In that direction, the Bracer could detect nearby anomalous","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T11:47:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165545712","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3194090-1835871199315791","game_id":"steam-3194090","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Playtest Access - June 27-28","summary":"Hello Field Agents and Operators, A new Paraxima Closed Playtest window will be available on June 27-28. Paraxima is a systemic co-op horror game up to 3 players built around containment, deduction, and asymmetric team coordination. One player operates from the Safe Room as the Operator, while Field Agents enter the Breach Zone to investigate, suppress anomalous activity, and identify what drives the Entity.This playtest is best experienced as a 3-person team, but you can still join if you are l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T14:57:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199315791","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3194090-1832065502820673","game_id":"steam-3194090","kind":"announcement","title":"The Investigation Begins","summary":"“Follow the rules to survive. Break them to come home.”Paraxima is an asymmetric co-op psychological horror built on a foundation of methodical investigation. Our goal is to create a high-tension environment where mission success hinges on your ability to observe, identify, and contain the Ent